   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Dock Text\n\nA pointer glides across a line of capitals and the letters near it stretch tall like a dock, the nearest one most, easing back to size when the pointer leaves.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 3.5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A short bold word in capitals should react to a moving pointer with a magnified, dock-style swell.\n- A playful interactive-feeling headline for a video.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The text should stay calm: use per-character-rise.\n- Lowercase or long sentences: the stretch reads best on a short word.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Text, default \"Make it grow\"\n- down (boolean): Grow downward, default false\n- start (number, 0-5): Pointer enters, default 0.4\n- sweep (number, 0.5-6): Sweep time, default 2.2\n- font_size (number, 12-260): Font size, default 120\n- color (color): Color, default \"#171717\"\n- font_weight (enum): Font weight, default \"700\"\n\nSource: https://github.com/karthikmudunuri/eldoraui. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Dock Text\n\n  A pointer glides across a line of capitals and the letters near it stretch tall like a dock, the nearest one most, easing back to size when the pointer leaves.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/karthikmudunuri/eldoraui/blob/6bb8fd211ecbdfa983f5780bead27d9f3890f20a/apps/www/registry/eldoraui/dock-text.tsx\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) Mudunuri Bhaskara Karthikeya Varma\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"dock-text\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"3.5\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    {\"id\": \"text\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Text\", \"description\": \"A short word or phrase; it is shown in capitals.\", \"default\": \"Make it grow\"},\n    {\"id\": \"down\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Grow downward\", \"description\": \"Anchor the stretch at the top so letters grow downward.\", \"default\": false},\n    {\"id\": \"start\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Pointer enters\", \"description\": \"Seconds before the pointer reaches the first letter.\", \"default\": 0.4, \"min\": 0, \"max\": 5, \"step\": 0.1, \"unit\": \"s\"},\n    {\"id\": \"sweep\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Sweep time\", \"description\": \"Seconds the pointer takes to cross the text.\", \"default\": 2.2, \"min\": 0.5, \"max\": 6, \"step\": 0.1, \"unit\": \"s\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Text size in pixels. The source is built for 72px type; its pixel offsets scale with this size.\", \"default\": 120, \"min\": 12, \"max\": 260, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Color\", \"description\": \"Text color.\", \"default\": \"#171717\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_weight\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font weight\", \"description\": \"Weight of the text.\", \"default\": \"700\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"400\", \"label\": \"Regular\"}, {\"value\": \"500\", \"label\": \"Medium\"}, {\"value\": \"600\", \"label\": \"Semibold\"}, {\"value\": \"700\", \"label\": \"Bold\"}, {\"value\": \"800\", \"label\": \"Extra bold\"}]}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Dock Text</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=block\" />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          color: var(--color, #171717);\n          font-family: var(--font-display, \"Geist\", system-ui, sans-serif);\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .dkt-stage {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          display: flex;\n          align-items: center;\n          justify-content: center;\n        }\n        .dkt-line { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.01em; white-space: pre; }\n        .dkt-ch { display: inline-block; }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"dock-text\" data-duration=\"3.5\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"dkt-clip\" class=\"dkt-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"3.5\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div id=\"dkt-line\" class=\"dkt-line\" role=\"img\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/CustomEase.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() : {};\n            function num(v, f, mn, mx) { var n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(mx, Math.max(mn, n)) : f; }\n            function str(v, f) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v : f; }\n            function pick(v, l, f) { return l.indexOf(String(v)) >= 0 ? String(v) : f; }\n            function bool(v, f) { if (typeof v === \"boolean\") return v; if (v === \"true\") return true; if (v === \"false\") return false; return f; }\n            if (typeof vars.color === \"string\" && vars.color) root.style.setProperty(\"--color\", vars.color);\n            gsap.registerPlugin(CustomEase);\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"3.5\");\n            // Motion tweens with no easing named run easeInOut.\n            var EIO = CustomEase.create(\"dkt-eio\", \"M0,0 C0.42,0 0.58,1 1,1\");\n            // Unit step response of a damped spring (semi-implicit Euler at 480 Hz), sampled once.\n            function springTable(k, c, m, dur) {\n              var dt = 1 / 480, x = 0, v = 0, out = [0];\n              for (var t = 0; t < dur; t += dt) { v += ((-k * (x - 1) - c * v) / m) * dt; x += v * dt; out.push(x); }\n              return out;\n            }\n            function springAt(tab, tau) {\n              if (tau <= 0) return 0;\n              var i = tau * 480; if (i >= tab.length - 1) return tab[tab.length - 1];\n              var j = Math.floor(i); return tab[j] + (tab[j + 1] - tab[j]) * (i - j);\n            }\n            var clock = { t: 0 };\n            function finish(tl, draw) {\n              if (draw) { tl.to(clock, { t: total, duration: total, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.t); } }, 0); draw(0); }\n              if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n              tl.seek(0);\n              window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n              window.__timelines[\"dock-text\"] = tl;\n            }\n\n\n            var line = document.getElementById(\"dkt-line\");\n            var text = str(vars.text, \"Make it grow\"), down = bool(vars.down, false);\n            var start = num(vars.start, 0.4, 0, 5), sweep = num(vars.sweep, 2.2, 0.5, 6);\n            var size = num(vars.font_size, 120, 12, 260);\n            line.style.fontSize = size + \"px\"; line.style.fontWeight = pick(vars.font_weight, [\"400\", \"500\", \"600\", \"700\", \"800\"], \"700\");\n            line.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", text);\n            var spans = Array.from(text).map(function (ch) {\n              var s = document.createElement(\"span\"); s.className = \"dkt-ch\"; s.textContent = ch === \" \" ? \" \" : ch;\n              s.style.transformOrigin = down ? \"top\" : \"bottom\"; line.appendChild(s); return s;\n            });\n            var maxW = root.clientWidth * 0.9;\n            if (line.scrollWidth > maxW) { size = size * maxW / line.scrollWidth; line.style.fontSize = size + \"px\"; }\n            var STEP = 1 / 120, steps = Math.ceil(total / STEP) + 1, sim = null, sig = \"\";\n            function easeIO(p) { return p < 0.5 ? 2 * p * p : 1 - Math.pow(-2 * p + 2, 2) / 2; }\n            function simulate() {\n              var centers = spans.map(function (s) { return s.offsetLeft + s.offsetWidth / 2; });\n              var W = line.offsetWidth, thr = size * 0.1;\n              var h = centers.join(\",\") + \"|\" + W + \"|\" + size; if (h === sig) return; sig = h;\n              var n = spans.length, x = [], v = [], out = [], hovered = null;\n              for (var i = 0; i < n; i++) { x.push(1); v.push(0); }\n              for (var k = 0; k < steps; k++) {\n                var t = k * STEP, p = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, (t - start) / sweep));\n                var px = -0.08 * W + (1.16 * W) * easeIO(p);\n                var inside = t >= start && t < start + sweep && px >= 0 && px <= W;\n                if (!inside) hovered = null;\n                else for (var i2 = 0; i2 < n; i2++) if (Math.abs(px - centers[i2]) <= thr) hovered = i2;\n                for (var i3 = 0; i3 < n; i3++) {\n                  var target = hovered === null ? 1 : Math.max(1, 1.3638 - Math.abs(i3 - hovered) * 0.1);\n                  // Spring: stiffness 150, damping 20, mass 0.5.\n                  v[i3] += ((-150 * (x[i3] - target) - 20 * v[i3]) / 0.5) * STEP; x[i3] += v[i3] * STEP;\n                }\n                out.push(x.slice());\n              }\n              sim = out;\n            }\n            function draw(t) {\n              simulate();\n              var i = Math.min(sim.length - 2, Math.max(0, t / STEP)), j = Math.floor(i), fr = i - j;\n              spans.forEach(function (s, n) { s.style.transform = \"scaleY(\" + (sim[j][n] + (sim[j + 1][n] - sim[j][n]) * fr) + \")\"; });\n            }\n            finish(gsap.timeline({ paused: true }), draw);\n\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
